      "widgets_values": [
        "# MODEL & LoRA LINKS\n\nOnly group **05 COMFY CACHE** loads models (to encode the dataset for ComfyUI's own trainer).\nGroups 00-04 (crop, resize, caption, export) use no model at all; AutoCropFaces downloads its\nRetinaFace weights itself.\n\n| models/ | file | download | page |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| text_encoders | qwen3vl_8b_ablit_int8.safetensors | _source not recorded yet; fill in_ | — |\n| vae | qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors | [file](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/vae/qwen_image_2.1_vae_bf16.safetensors) | [Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1) |\n\nThe LoRA this dataset trains is meant for `qwen-image-2.1-UC-Q8_0.gguf` (slot 4 in the Character flows).\nDownloads go on the host only (`~/git/civitai_dl.sh` for CivitAI files)."
      ],
